{#
| Variable            | Type    | Description                                                                 |
|---------------------|---------|------------------------------------------------------------------------------|
| cart                | object  |                                                                                |
| cart.items_count    | int     |                                                                                |
| cart.total          | string  | Formatted total ex: "١٠٠ ر.س"                                                 |
| store.logo          | string  |                                                                                |
| store.name          | string  |                                                                                |
| store.url           | string  |                                                                                |
| store.scope         | ?object | current branch, null unless the "branches" feature is enabled                |
| store.settings      | object  | .is_multilingual / .currencies_enabled toggle the localization pill          |
| theme.settings.get  | fn      | reads a value declared in the "settings" array of twilight.json              |

  Premium header (Celia-inspired) — alternative to header.twig, selected from
  master.twig via theme.settings.get('enable_premium_header').

  ASSUMPTIONS — please verify against live Twilight docs/dashboard once available:
  1. Customer wishlist page route slug is `customer.wishlist` (matches the
     src/views/pages/customer/wishlist.twig file convention used elsewhere in
     this theme; confirmed against Salla's Wishlist Page Guide).
  2. There is no ready-made "wishlist summary" web component in Twilight (checked
     against the upstream SallaApp/theme-raed header — it has none either), so
     the live badge count is computed client-side in header-premium.js from
     `salla.storage.get('salla::wishlist', [])` + `salla.wishlist.event.on*`,
     the same primitives src/assets/js/wishlist.js already relies on.
  3. `sicon-search` is confirmed present in Salla's icon font (grepped inside
     node_modules/@salla.sa/twilight-components). There is no `sicon-heart` in
     that font though — Salla's own salla-product-card wishlist toggle draws
     an inline IcoMoon SVG instead, so the wishlist icon below reuses that
     exact path for visual consistency with the rest of the storefront.
  4. The search icon dispatches `salla.event.dispatch('search::open')` to open
     the sitewide `<salla-search data-testid="store-search-modal">` instance
     already rendered once in master.twig — confirmed by reading
     node_modules/@salla.sa/twilight-components' salla-search source
     (`salla.event.on('search::open', () => this.open())`), the same
     dispatch/listen idiom this theme already uses for `scopes::open` below.
  5. Dark/light mode is intentionally NOT reimplemented here — it reuses the
     site-wide mechanism already shipped in master.twig (FOUC-safe inline
     script) and app.js `initiateDarkMode()` (localStorage key
     `aser-color-mode`, `.dark` class on `<html>`), triggered by the same
     `[data-dark-mode-toggle]` attribute used in header.twig.
  6. The "transparent over hero banner" treatment is intentionally scoped to
     `is_page('index')` only (via the `.header-premium--hero` modifier) rather
     than sitewide — a transparent header with light-on-hero text would be
     unreadable on inner pages that don't open with a full-bleed banner. If a
     merchant relies on `fixed-banner`/hero blocks on other page types too,
     extend this condition accordingly.
#}
{% set announcement_text = theme.settings.get('announcement_text') %}
{% set announcement_link = theme.settings.get('announcement_link') %}
{% set show_announcement = theme.settings.get('enable_announcement_bar', true) and announcement_text %}
{% set show_wishlist = theme.settings.get('enable_wishlist_icon', true) %}
{% set show_dark_toggle = theme.settings.get('enable_dark_mode_toggle', true) %}
{% set show_localization = store.settings.is_multilingual or store.settings.currencies_enabled %}

<a href="#main-content" class="skip-to-content">{{ trans('common.titles.skip_to_content') }}</a>

{# Scroll sentinel — sits in normal flow *before* the sticky header so the
   IntersectionObserver in header-premium.js can flip the header's background
   from transparent to solid the instant it scrolls out of the viewport. #}
<span class="header-premium-sentinel" data-scroll-sentinel aria-hidden="true"></span>

{% if show_announcement %}
<div class="announcement-bar" data-announcement-bar data-announcement-text="{{ announcement_text|e('html_attr') }}">
  <div class="container announcement-bar__inner">
    <div class="announcement-bar__spacer" aria-hidden="true"></div>
    {% if announcement_link %}
      <a href="{{ announcement_link }}" class="announcement-bar__text">{{ announcement_text }}</a>
    {% else %}
      <p class="announcement-bar__text">{{ announcement_text }}</p>
    {% endif %}
    <button type="button" class="announcement-bar__close" data-announcement-dismiss aria-label="{{ trans('common.titles.dismiss_announcement') }}">
      <svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" width="14" height="14" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round"><path d="M6 6l12 12M18 6L6 18"/></svg>
    </button>
  </div>
</div>
{% endif %}

<header data-testid="store-header-premium" id="premium-header" class="header-premium font-primary{{ is_page('index') ? ' header-premium--hero' : '' }}" data-header-premium>
  <div class="header-premium__row container">

    {# ============ START (right side in RTL): burger + logo ============ #}
    <div class="header-premium__group header-premium__group--start">
      <button type="button" class="header-premium__burger" data-mobile-menu-toggle aria-haspopup="true" aria-expanded="false" aria-controls="premium-mobile-nav" aria-label="{{ trans('blocks.header.main_menu') }}">
        <span class="header-premium__burger-bar"></span>
        <span class="header-premium__burger-bar"></span>
        <span class="header-premium__burger-bar"></span>
      </button>

      <a href="{{ store.url }}" class="header-premium__logo" data-testid="store-header-logo" aria-label="{{ store.name }}">
        {% if store.logo %}
          <img src="{{ store.logo|cdn(200) }}" alt="{{ store.name }}" class="header-premium__logo-img" width="160" height="56" fetchpriority="high">
        {% else %}
          {# graceful fallback when no logo image is set: elegant serif wordmark #}
          <span class="header-premium__wordmark">{{ store.name }}</span>
        {% endif %}
        {% if is_page('index') %}
          <h1 class="sr-only">{{ store.name }}</h1>
        {% else %}
          <h2 class="sr-only">{{ store.name }}</h2>
        {% endif %}
      </a>
    </div>

    {# ============ CENTER: primary navigation (desktop) ============ #}
    <div class="header-premium__group header-premium__group--center">
      <premium-main-menu
        class="header-premium__menu-root"
        data-store-name="{{ store.name|e('html_attr') }}"
        data-menu-label="{{ trans('blocks.header.main_menu')|e('html_attr') }}"
        data-close-label="{{ trans('common.titles.close_menu')|e('html_attr') }}"
      ></premium-main-menu>
    </div>

    {# ============ END (left side in RTL): utility icons ============ #}
    <div class="header-premium__group header-premium__group--end">

      {% if show_localization or store.scope %}
        <div class="header-premium__utility-pills">
          {% if store.scope %}
            <button type="button" class="header-premium__pill" onclick="salla.event.dispatch('scopes::open', {'mode': 'default'})">
              <i class="sicon-location"></i>
              <span class="truncate max-w-[90px]">{{ store.scope.name }}</span>
            </button>
          {% endif %}
          {% if show_localization %}
            <salla-localization-modal data-testid="store-header-localization" show-trigger class="header-premium__pill"></salla-localization-modal>
          {% endif %}
        </div>
      {% endif %}

      {# Search: opens the sitewide salla-search modal already rendered once in master.twig (see assumption #4 above) #}
      <button type="button" class="header-premium__icon-btn" aria-label="{{ trans('common.titles.search') }}" onclick="salla.event.dispatch('search::open')">
        <i class="sicon-search"></i>
      </button>

      {% if show_wishlist %}
        {# Heart glyph matches Salla's own salla-product-card wishlist icon (IcoMoon path) — there is no sicon-heart in the icon font. #}
        <a href="{{ link('customer.wishlist') }}" class="header-premium__icon-btn" data-wishlist-trigger aria-label="{{ trans('common.titles.wishlist') }}">
          <svg viewBox="0 0 32 32" width="19" height="19" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2"><path d="M23.333 2.267c-3.547 0-5.779 1.605-7.333 3.061-1.555-1.456-3.787-3.061-7.333-3.061-5.955 0-8.667 5.045-8.667 9.733 0 8.503 10.147 14.735 15.513 16.841 0.156 0.061 0.321 0.092 0.487 0.092s0.331-0.031 0.487-0.092c5.367-2.107 15.513-8.339 15.513-16.841 0-4.688-2.712-9.733-8.667-9.733zM16 26.161c-5.537-2.309-13.333-7.799-13.333-14.161 0-3.517 1.856-7.067 6-7.067 2.983 0 4.656 1.451 6.384 3.203 0.5 0.508 1.399 0.508 1.899 0 1.728-1.752 3.401-3.203 6.384-3.203 4.144 0 6 3.549 6 7.067 0 6.363-7.796 11.852-13.333 14.161z"/></svg>
          <span class="header-premium__badge" data-wishlist-count hidden>0</span>
        </a>
      {% endif %}

      <div class="header-premium__icon-btn header-premium__icon-btn--account">
        <salla-user-menu data-testid="store-header-user-menu" avatar-only show-header show-trigger></salla-user-menu>
      </div>

      <div class="header-premium__icon-btn header-premium__icon-btn--cart" data-cart-icon>
        <salla-cart-summary data-testid="store-header-cart">
          <i slot="icon" class="sicon-shopping-bag"></i>
        </salla-cart-summary>
      </div>

      {% if show_dark_toggle %}
        <button type="button" class="header-premium__icon-btn dark-mode-toggle" data-dark-mode-toggle aria-label="{{ trans('common.titles.toggle_dark_mode') }}">
          <svg class="dark-mode-toggle__icon dark-mode-toggle__icon--moon" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"><path d="M21 12.79A9 9 0 1 1 11.21 3 7 7 0 0 0 21 12.79z"></path></svg>
          <svg class="dark-mode-toggle__icon dark-mode-toggle__icon--sun" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"><circle cx="12" cy="12" r="5"></circle><path d="M12 1v2M12 21v2M4.22 4.22l1.42 1.42M18.36 18.36l1.42 1.42M1 12h2M21 12h2M4.22 19.78l1.42-1.42M18.36 5.64l1.42-1.42"></path></svg>
        </button>
      {% endif %}
    </div>

  </div>
</header>
